skill: "chopify"
sections[9]:
  - "\n"
  - "# Chopify Headless Video Clipper\n\nChopify converts long local recordings, video URLs, or live streams into scored, captioned vertical (9:16), square (1:1), or widescreen (16:9) clips locally with zero cloud uploads, zero API keys, and zero watermarks.\n\n"
  - "## AGYOS Execution Entrypoints\n\n- **Agent NDJSON CLI (default)**: `./bin/chopify <command> ...` or `./bin/agyos chopify <command> ...`\n- **Direct CLI**: `./bin/chopify cli <source> [options]`\n- **Local Studio UI (loopback 127.0.0.1 only)**: `./bin/chopify studio`\n- **Source Checkout**: [integrations/chopify](../../../integrations/chopify/README.md) (MIT License)\n\n`bin/chopify` resolves the isolated virtual environment via `uv` (`$CHOPIFY_VENV`, `~/.chopify/venv`, or `integrations/chopify/.venv`).\n\n"
  - "## Output Contract (NDJSON)\n\n`./bin/chopify` prints newline-delimited JSON to stdout (`event`, `op`, `ts`, `request_id`). Parse the final line: `result` (with `data`) or `error` (with `code`, `message`, `retryable`, `details`). Pass `--verbose` to forward human logs to stderr.\n\nExit codes: `0` success, `2` invalid input, `3` operation failed, `4` timeout.\n\n"
  - "## Core Commands\n\n`describe`, `preflight`, `styles`, `project create|get|prepare|render|wait`, `batch create|wait`, `live start|status|stop`.\n\n"
  - "## End-to-End Clipping Workflow\n\n1. `./bin/chopify describe` — inspect the live operation catalog and JSON Schemas.\n2. `./bin/chopify preflight` — verify `ffmpeg`, `ffprobe`, `yt_dlp`, `faster_whisper`, and `opencv-python` before starting.\n3. `./bin/chopify project create --source <SOURCE> --options-json '{\"aspect\":\"9:16\",\"style\":\"hormozi\",\"tighten\":true,\"loudnorm\":true}'` — save returned `id` and `path`.\n4. `./bin/chopify project prepare --project <PATH>` — transcribes, detects video type (`podcast`, `gaming`, `movie`, `livestream`, `interview`, `tutorial`, `music`), scores multi-modal evidence (text + 1Hz audio energy + 2fps OpenCV visual action), and writes `candidates.json`, `selection.json`, and `segments.json`.\n5. `./bin/chopify project get --project <PATH>` — review `candidates`, `selection`, `detection`, and `format_recipe`. Scores are editing suggestions, not virality guarantees.\n6. `./bin/chopify project render --project <PATH> --pick 1,3 --out <DIR>` — renders selected 1-based clips with speaker-tracked crop (`single`, `split`, or `stacked`), word-level ASS captions, `--tighten` filler/silence removal, and `-14 LUFS` normalization.\n7. `./bin/chopify project wait --project <PATH> --timeout 600` — wait until settled (`review` or `complete`).\n8. Verify exports with `uv run scripts/video_pipeline.py self-eval <clip.mp4> --json`.\n\n"
  - "## Advanced Capabilities\n\n- **Campaign Brief Filtering**: Pass `brief` or `brief_file` in options to extract `must_mention`, `banned`, duration, and aspect rules via local LLM or keyword fallback.\n- **13 Caption Presets**: `default`, `clean`, `minimal`, `bold`, `boxed`, `karaoke`, `pop`, `neon`, `typewriter`, `retro`, `hormozi`, `mrbeast`, `podcast` (plus custom brand JSON presets).\n- **Long Sources (>= 2h or >= 8 GiB)**: Automatically chunks transcription into 30-minute blocks and downloads only selected padded sections for rendering.\n- **Podcast & Gaming Layouts**: Use `layout: \"split\"` with `centers: [0.25, 0.75]` for two-speaker podcasts, or `layout: \"stacked\"` for gaming facecam-over-gameplay.\n\n"
  - "## AGYOS Post-Production Handoff\n\n- Audit vertical retention and safe zones (1080x1400 active window) with [vertical-video-psychology](../vertical-video-psychology/SKILL.md).\n- Apply organic film finishing or audio mastering via [organic-film-de-ai](../organic-film-de-ai/SKILL.md) and [ffmpeg-video-editor](../ffmpeg-video-editor/SKILL.md).\n- Coordinate multi-tool pipelines via [video-production-orchestrator](../video-production-orchestrator/SKILL.md).\n\n"
  - "## Constraints & Error Recovery\n\n- Keep project files, transcripts, and Studio tokens strictly local; never publish or upload clips without explicit user approval.\n- Read [LIVE.md](../../../integrations/chopify/docs/LIVE.md) for stream rights obligations before using `live start`.\n- On `TIMEOUT`, poll `project get` rather than restarting. On `RENDER_FAILED`, inspect `details.render_errors` and retry only failed clip numbers.\n"
